# Maintainer-only paths (CI, private planning notes, the local denylist) never enter the release
# tarball (git archive); release/build.py refuses the notes and the denylist again.
docs/INVENTORY.md export-ignore
docs/PLAN.md export-ignore
docs/OPEN-QUESTIONS.md export-ignore
docs/build/ export-ignore
release/denylist* export-ignore
.github/ export-ignore
